ion along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Nate took his turtles for a walk today. (event_time: 2022-10-25T20:16:00Z)\n  - Nate is showing his cute turtles. (event_time: 2022-09-05T18:03:00Z)\n  - Nate finds happiness watching his turtles slowly walk around. (event_time: 2022-10-21T14:01:00Z)\n  - Nate took his turtles to the beach in Tampa. (event_time: 2022-11-10T00:00:00Z)\n  - Nate's turtles bring him peace. (event_time: 2022-11-11T00:06:00Z)\n  - Nate will give the turtles a bath before Joanna arrives. (event_time: 2022-11-09T17:54:00Z)\n  - Nate's turtles always cheer him up. (event_time: 2022-10-21T14:01:00Z)\n  - Nate has turtles (event_time: 2022-03-18T18:59:00Z)\n  - Nate feels that turtles remind him to slow down and appreciate the small things in life. (event_time: 2022-11-11T00:06:00Z)\n  - Nate will send pictures of his turtles to Joanna (event_time: 2022-03-18T18:59:00Z)\n  - Nate stated that Nate loves turtles. (event_time: 2022-11-04T15:56:00Z)\n  - The turtles will be ready to play with Joanna after Nate bathes them. (event_time: 2022-11-09T17:54:00Z)\n  - Nate knows all about turtles. (event_time: 2022-10-25T20:16:00Z)\n  - Turtles have an effect on Nate (event_time: 2022-11-09T17:54:00Z)\n  - Joanna commented that Nate's turtles are cute. (event_time: 2022-09-05T18:03:00Z)\n  - Nate has liked turtles since he was a boy. (event_time: 2022-10-25T20:16:00Z)\n  - Joanna asked Nate about the current condition of his turtles. (event_time: 2022-11-07T20:10:00Z)\n  - Nate enjoys watching the pets play with each other. (event_time: 2022-05-25T15:00:00Z)\n  - Nate acquired another turtle (event_time: 2022-11-09T17:54:00Z)\n  - Nate really r