ience there.\n  - online store: Gina is growing the customer base for her online store, finding the work tough but remaining determined. She plans to work with fashion bloggers/influencers and run more ads.\n  - stuff: Gina's clothing store has its 'stuff' on display, and Jon congratulated her on how great it looks and the payoff of her hard work.\n  - my own biz: Gina was noticed by fashion editors. Jon is going full-time with his biz idea after losing his job and is learning marketing/analytics tools to advance it.\n  - Gina: Gina is keeping up with fashion trends to offer the best pieces to customers and is enjoying running her business.\n  - Gina: Gina designed a cozy and inviting space for her store. Jon congratulated her on finding the perfect spot for her store.\n  - Gina: Gina started an online clothing store after losing her job to take control of her destiny. The journey has been tough but rewarding. She encouraged Jon to believe in himself.\n  - sales: Gina is focused on growing her customer base, seeing more sales due to new offers and promotions on her online store, and looking for unique, trendy pieces.\n  - fashion mag: Gina got the idea for a new fashion piece for her store from a fashion magazine.\n  - trendy pieces: Gina sourced trendy pieces for her store after facing hurdles with sourcing, advising Jon to network for help and contacts.\n  - fashion fans: Gina is focused on making her online store a top destination for fashion fans.\n  - fashion bloggers: Gina plans to work with fashion bloggers and influencers in the next few months to get more attention for her online store.\n  - dance-inspired items: Gina is adding dance-inspired items to her online store to show creativity and share her passion for dance and fashion.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1434,"context_chars":5766,"retrieval_duration":0.16315865516662598,"response_duration":4.409322500228882,"total_duration":4.572481155395508,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer ment